      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181024",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0401068",
      "dcterms:abstract": "@We show that for a twist knot, the A-polynomial can be obtained from recur- rences for the summand in Masbaum’s formula of the colored Jones polynomial. Our result supports the AJ conjecture due to S.Garoufalidis.",
